1
00:00:02,136 --> 00:00:03,416
After the gates close,

2
00:00:03,436 --> 00:00:04,801
there's one more story,

3
00:00:04,821 --> 00:00:06,996
called The Sins of Our Fathers.

4
00:00:07,076 --> 00:00:08,556
It belongs to Filip,

5
00:00:08,576 --> 00:00:10,856
the son of Naomi and Marco,

6
00:00:10,876 --> 00:00:12,881
the boy who helped drop rocks on

7
00:00:12,901 --> 00:00:13,856
Earth.

8
00:00:13,876 --> 00:00:15,581
Now he's a grown man on one

9
00:00:15,601 --> 00:00:17,076
of those cut off worlds,

10
00:00:17,096 --> 00:00:18,876
trying to be someone else.

11
00:00:18,896 --> 00:00:20,227
Spoilers ahead!

12
00:00:20,967 --> 00:00:22,707
Filip lives on a small,

13
00:00:22,727 --> 00:00:25,557
struggling colony of a few hundred people.

14
00:00:25,577 --> 00:00:27,202
He goes by another name,

15
00:00:27,222 --> 00:00:29,742
Jacek, and nobody there knows what he

16
00:00:29,762 --> 00:00:30,667
did.

17
00:00:30,687 --> 00:00:31,992
The gates are gone,

18
00:00:32,012 --> 00:00:33,792
and no help is coming.

19
00:00:33,812 --> 00:00:36,067
Then an alien predator starts stalking the

20
00:00:36,087 --> 00:00:38,942
settlers, and their children are in danger.

21
00:00:39,628 --> 00:00:41,533
The colonists don't know how to fight

22
00:00:41,553 --> 00:00:42,058
it.

23
00:00:42,078 --> 00:00:43,503
Filip does.

24
00:00:43,638 --> 00:00:44,668
To kill the beast,

25
00:00:44,688 --> 00:00:46,418
he has to use everything his father

26
00:00:46,438 --> 00:00:48,163
taught him: patience,

27
00:00:48,183 --> 00:00:50,233
tactics, and ruthlessness.

28
00:00:50,253 --> 00:00:52,028
He saves the children.

29
00:00:52,078 --> 00:00:54,833
But using Marco's skills brings back Marco's

30
00:00:54,853 --> 00:00:55,958
crimes.

31
00:00:55,978 --> 00:00:57,908
Filip has to decide whose son he

32
00:00:57,928 --> 00:00:59,483
really is, his father's,

33
00:00:59,503 --> 00:01:00,621
or his mother's.

34
00:01:01,398 --> 00:01:03,428
And then, the very end.

35
00:01:03,448 --> 00:01:05,253
A thousand years pass.

36
00:01:05,273 --> 00:01:07,188
The scattered worlds grow apart,

37
00:01:07,208 --> 00:01:09,113
and some learn to cross the stars

38
00:01:09,133 --> 00:01:10,563
without the gates.

39
00:01:10,583 --> 00:01:12,633
One day, a ship from far away

40
00:01:12,653 --> 00:01:14,893
reaches Earth, and the man who greets

41
00:01:14,913 --> 00:01:16,668
them is Amos Burton,

42
00:01:16,688 --> 00:01:19,486
still here, still looking after his people.

43
00:01:20,200 --> 00:01:22,185
That's the whole story of The Expanse:

44
00:01:22,205 --> 00:01:23,883
a drive, a war,

45
00:01:23,903 --> 00:01:26,105
a Ring, a thousand worlds,

46
00:01:26,125 --> 00:01:28,180
and the people who held them together.

47
00:01:28,200 --> 00:01:29,680
Thanks for watching.

48
00:01:29,700 --> 00:01:30,550
The end.

